@startuml C4-Dynamic-Document-Upload
!include style-zinc.puml

title Dynamic — Document upload ETL

actor User as user
participant "RAG page\n/rag" as ui <<ui>>
participant "Java API\nrag module :9000" as api <<java>>
participant "Ollama\nembed :11434" as ollama <<external>>
database "H2" as db <<db>>

user -> ui: 1. Choose PDF/text file
ui -> api: 2. POST /api/rag/documents/upload
api -> db: 3. Persist Document UPLOADING
api -> api: 4. Read, chunk, mark PROCESSING
api -> ollama: 5. Embed chunks
ollama --> api: 6. Vectors
api -> db: 7. MERGE DocumentChunk + embeddings
api -> db: 8. Graph index (optional)
api -> db: 9. markReady() or FAILED
api --> ui: 10. 201 UploadDocumentResponse
ui --> user: 11. Document appears in rail

legend right
  |= Role |= Color |
  | Actor | Emerald |
  | <<ui>> | Slate |
  | <<java>> | Blue |
  | <<db>> | Amber |
  | <<external>> | Zinc gray |
endlegend

note right of api
  Mutations require
  X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest
end note

@enduml
